# Layer and hard stops

Schema source of truth: [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md) (Sec 2 layers, Sec 10 copyright, Sec 13 git). Do not paste AGENTS.md here. If this rule conflicts, **AGENTS.md wins**.

## Layers (do not conflate)

- `raw/` — immutable sources. **Never write.**
- `KB/` — Librarian only. YAML pages, not a `wiki/` directory. **Never create `wiki/`.**
- `docs/` and `games/` — shipping after review.
- `reference/` — read-only patterns, not project truth.
- `.cursor/` — editor tooling (rules/skills). Not a fifth knowledge layer.

## Hard stops

- Never commit Games Workshop binaries (PDF, webp, png, jpg, …). Owned libraries stay outside git (`C:\Personal\40K`, `C:\Personal\Kill Team`); markdown path pointers only.
- Owned magazine scans (e.g. White Dwarf) stay outside git — path pointers only; research notes under `raw/<source>/` are **markdown only** (Coordinator / research Implementer; Librarian never writes `raw/`).
- UTF-8, no BOM.
- `git commit` / `git push` only when the **user explicitly gates** it. Coordinator is otherwise the sole git owner. Subagents never git.
- Teaching paraphrase in `KB/` and 40K army pages. Scoped verbatim quotes only on AGENTS.md Sec 10 paths.
- **Print exports:** UNOFFICIAL banner + non-endorsement footer on `games/**` print HTML — see [`gw-unofficial-footer.mdc`](gw-unofficial-footer.mdc).

## Collection fact

**Kill Team: Tomb World is owned and game-ready.** Do not deny ownership or treat it as superseded.
